GlassBox-NR Anatomy -- implementation-level dissection of nvngx_dlssnr.dll 310.8.0.0.
Companion documentation to GlassBox-NR (https://github.com/Ashley-QwQ/GlassBox-NR), an independent CPU C++
reimplementation of the inference chain of that one fixed target library. Not applicable to other versions.

