NVIDIA materials
================

No NVIDIA library, DLL, weights, or any bytes derived from the weight bytes are included in this repository.
Running the examples that need the companion release requires the user's own, lawfully obtained copy of
`nvngx_dlssnr.dll`, as described in GlassBox-NR. NVIDIA and related names are trademarks of their owners; this
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.

Provenance records
==================

Many pages and receipts cite the authors' private project archive (relative `../../../experiments/...` links,
local absolute paths and internal round names). They are kept unchanged as provenance records: several are covered
by sha256 pins in `skewer/examples/`, and rewriting them would change those pins. They do not resolve outside the
original project layout.

If you redistribute a modified version of this documentation, please note that it is based on GlassBox-NR Anatomy.
